,"shaodi-e-o073a-q"]}],"order":1147},{"id":"santizhu-e-sr-liuzan-death","title":"蒋班败留赞于菰陂、留赞孙楞蒋修遇害","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-4761f1ed4e39d8671a18","label":"正文","text":"留赞为诸葛诞别将蒋班所败于菰陂，赞及将军孙楞、蒋修等皆遇害","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wgc-p0019","role":"于菰陂击败留赞（诸葛诞别将）","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0076","role":"战败遇害","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0009","role":"遇害","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0010","role":"遇害","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b","source_order":[48,54,0],"related_events":[{"event":"shaodi-e-o073a","type":"alternative","evidence":["santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b","shaodi-e-o073a-q"]},{"event":"santizhu064-e-sr-liuzan-death-wushu","type":"alternative","evidence":["santizhu064-q-51aceda50efd02b54ab2","santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b"]}],"order":8461}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0010","name":"蒋修","evidence":["santizhu-q-b2b3977b84b3b8706bb3"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-9b248481834fb33d577b","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-d33ac4d7966626cd5c5b","layer":"original","quote":"留赞为诞别将蒋班所败于菰陂〖9〗，赞及将军孙楞、蒋修等，皆遇害。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":153,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-b2b3977b84b3b8706bb3","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-d33ac4d7966626cd5c5b","layer":"original","quote":"留赞为诞别将蒋班所败于菰陂〖9〗，赞及将军孙楞、蒋修等，皆遇害","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":153,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-20d87b32e3639cb4e23a","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-c440da85565fe532313d","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖9〗，魏将毌丘俭、文钦以众叛，与魏人战于乐嘉〖10〗。峻帅骠骑将军吕据、左将军留赞袭寿春；会钦败降，军还","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":390,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-51aceda50efd02b54ab2","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-d6d1b5c9cae4cad8e15d","layer":"pei","quote":"孙峻征淮南，授赞节，拜左护军。未至寿春，道路病发，峻令赞将车重先还。魏将蒋班，以步骑四千追赞。赞病困，不能整阵；知必败，乃解曲盖、印绶，付弟子以归，曰：‘吾自为将，破敌搴旗，未尝负败。今病困兵羸，众寡不敌；汝速去矣，俱死无益于国，适所以快敌耳。’弟子不肯受，拔刀欲斫之，乃去。初，赞为将，临敌必先被发叫天，因抗音而歌，左右应之；毕，乃进战，战无不克。及败，叹曰：‘吾战有常术，今病困若此，固命也！’遂被害，时年七十三。众庶痛惜焉。二子：略、平，并为大将。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9d9f10434c65e6735646","start":299,"end":527,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o073a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-edb853525f526ca4c6d7","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖18〗，吴大将孙峻等众号十万〖19〗，至寿春；诸葛诞拒击破之，斩吴左将军留赞〖20〗，献捷于京都。三月，立皇后卞氏〖21〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗二年：正元二年（公元 255）。乙丑：旧历十二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-96103ace1e11ae4131ba","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o072","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o073","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-edb853525f526ca4c6d7","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖18〗，吴大将孙峻等众号十万〖19〗，至寿春；诸葛诞拒击破之，斩吴左将军留赞〖20〗，献捷于京都。三月，立皇后卞氏〖21〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0024","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b65f0eafd40a24300f7f","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将孙峻、吕据、留赞等闻淮南乱〖10〗，会文钦往，乃帅众将钦径至寿春。时诞诸军已至，城不可攻，乃走。诞遣将军蒋班追击之，斩赞；传首，收其印、节。进封高平侯，邑三千五百户；转为征东大将军。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0263","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b65f0eafd40a24300f7f","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将孙峻、吕据、留赞等闻淮南乱〖10〗，会文钦往，乃帅众将钦径至寿春。时诞诸军已至，城不可攻，乃走","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0264","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-b65f0eafd40a24300f7f","layer":"original","quote":"诞遣将军蒋班追击之，斩赞；传首，收其印、节","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
